      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE JONNY (1) settled well back early on debut and but the line nicely when third (18.03) at this track over 324m. Has the inside draw this time. Improver who can get off the mark this time. SHOW LESS (8) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when eighth at Gosford over 515m behind Trunkey Moth (30.88) in a Maiden. Was in the money prior to that. The form from his last run stacks up well. Leading chance. TICKET MAN (6) made a promising debut when hitting the frame, finishing third (22.86) at Bulli over 400m. Expected to do much better this time. IBROX HIGH (3) is a William Dance-trained newcomer by Shima Shine out of Mayfair Reign. Profiles nicely but market best guide to ability.",
